Before a meeting of the members of the Logical Language Group I decided to 
make a translation of a short story by Edward Plunkett (Lord Dunsany).
I translated it into reduced Lojban for new learners, into richer Lojban 
and into Russian.

Even if you can't read Lojban reading the English original could be 
interesting as well.

https://la-lojban.github.io/lojban/en/how-the-enemy-came-to-thlunrana/

